  "project_description": "This module gives you a date pager for views to page any datetime fields.\n\nThe granularity is flexible, you can page by years / month / days / hours so far.\n\n The following field types are supported: \n\n \n datetime \n daterange \n changed \n created \n smartdate \n \n Once you activate the module, you will have a date pager option available in views.",
